WELCOME TO THE CAVERN ADVENTURE 
 
You are a brave explorer seeking hidden treasure beneath the earth. 
These caverns are said to hold valuable artifacts and a final locked gate. 
 
Each directory represents a Chamber or a Room, containing puzzle tasks. 
Read the local "README.1ST" for clues on which commands to use. 
 
Goal: create a key with the word "VICTORY" to unlock the Great Door 
Beware a hidden Nether Portal that ends the game if entered. 
 
Good luck, explorer, and remember to type "help" at any time 
 
START THE GAME: 
    cd CavernAdventure\TheEntrance\Room1 
Follow the clues and complete the tasks. 
